e><table-wrap-foot><fn id="t2-fn1"><label/><p>NA=not available. <xref rid="tbl2" ref-type="table">Table 2</xref> shows the histoscore for cytoplasmic phosphorylated Akt and PI3K in hormone-sensitive tumours (HS) and hormone-refractory tumours (HR). Group 1 represents those patients with no increase in phosphorylated AR expression, and group 2 represents those patients with an increase in phosphorylated AR expression in the transition from hormone-sensitive to hormone-refractory disease.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>